D3 hpa-none                   con-tosg
D3 l2-pool-ps                 con-tosg
D3 reach-pool-ps              con-tosg
D3 reach-pool-ps              bal
D3 l2-pool-ps                 bal
D3 reach-pool-ps-min0         bal
D3 off                        bal
D3 reach_green-pool-ps-min0   bal
D3 hpa-none                   bal

# ── ripetizione 4 ──
